1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,675
Is OpusClip worth it for Kick streamers?

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:06,946
For podcasts and finished videos, OpusClip is solid.

3
00:00:06,946 --> 00:00:08,913
For Kick streamers, it has gaps.

4
00:00:08,913 --> 00:00:12,539
You upload after the stream, and credits run by the minute.

5
00:00:13,489 --> 00:00:15,161
ClipMe is built for Kick.

6
00:00:15,161 --> 00:00:17,969
It reads Kick chat, and it prices per VOD.

7
00:00:18,919 --> 00:00:21,264
There's no per-minute credit meter.

8
00:00:21,264 --> 00:00:25,084
Starter is free with a watermark, and Pro is $29 a month.

9
00:00:26,035 --> 00:00:30,814
On Kick, chat activity is one of the signals ClipMe uses to rank each moment.

10
00:00:31,763 --> 00:00:35,881
See how ClipMe compares to OpusClip for Kick at clipme.com.

11
00:00:35,881 --> 00:00:38,184
Paste a Kick VOD and try it free.

